<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Del Gottardo Lugano and Bank Von Ernst.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    25.SEP.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.10    PAY DATE    25.SEP.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
